<title>FRANCE: Cr Foncier makes 858 mln Ffr profit in 96.</title>
<headline>Cr Foncier makes 858 mln Ffr profit in 96.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French home loans group Credit Foncier, which recently won a government stay of execution to avoid break-up and seek a rescue partner, said on Thursday it pulled out of the red in 1996 to produce a consolidated profit of 858 million francs.</p>
</text>
